# --- benchmark data: override the broad proxy-scaffold rules above ---
# Keep the corpus, caches, rendered reports, and the full raw call logs so the
# benchmark is reproducible from a clone.
!benchmark/data/
!benchmark/data/**
!benchmark/results/
!benchmark/results/**
# junk the broad re-include above would otherwise pull back in
benchmark/.venv/
benchmark/results/archive/
